name: ['Aether Hub', 'Fatal Push', "Fortune's Favor", 'Incendiary Flow', 'Noose Constrictor', 'Renegade Rallier', 'Reverse Engineer', 'Servo Exhibition', 'Unlicensed Disintegration']
